  "body": "How low will the vendor go? Enquire today and find out!\r\n\r\n*\t4 bedrooms + study | 3 bathrooms + guest toilet | 1 garage\r\n*\tContemporary two-level home with a clean, modern aesthetic\r\n*\tOpen-plan kitchen, dining and living designed for everyday connection\r\n*\tThree bathrooms providing flexibility for families and guests \r\n*\tWell-proportioned bedrooms with plenty of natural light\r\n*\tLow-maintenance section and generous outdoor timber deck offering an easy-care lifestyle\r\n*\tConvenient Silverdale location close to Hibiscus Coast Station and Park & Ride, motorway connections, schools, beaches and Paknsave \r\n\r\nWell presented and positioned in a super convenient Silverdale location, this low maintenance home will appeal to first home buyers, investors, and downsizers alike.\r\n\r\nInside, the home offers four well sized bedrooms, a modern kitchen with quality appliance, open plan living, and year round comfort with double glazing and heat pump. The living area flows effortlessly to a private outdoor space designed for easy entertaining and minimal upkeep.  Three bathrooms provide added convenience and flexibility for families and guests, helping busy mornings run smoothly while ensuring everyone enjoys their own space and comfort. Adding extra flexibility, the study room at ground level provides an ideal space for working from home, studying, or managing your day-to-day tasks. Fully fenced and low maintenance, this property is all about comfortable living in a sought after Silverdale location, local shops, cafes, and public transport all within easy reach. \r\n\r\nA smart option for those wanting convenience, comfort, and an easy lifestyle. Or, if you'd like to take the bus, it's only 3 minutes' walk to the Hibiscus Coast bus depot.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson & Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit one of our upcoming open homes.",
